# Benchmark: recursion
# Workload: naive Fibonacci of 12 (about 465 calls) and a recursive sum to a
# depth of 100 (Otter's call depth limit is 250). Measures call depth handling.

to fib n
    if n is less than 2
        return n
    .
    n minus 1 make left
    n minus 2 make right
    fib left make a1
    fib right make a2
    return a1 plus a2
.

to sumTo n
    if n is less than 1
        return 0
    .
    n minus 1 make smaller
    sumTo smaller make rest
    return n plus rest
.

fib 12 make result
sumTo 100 make summed
say "recursion" result summed
